A small sunflower has 3 dozen seeds and a large sunflower has 50% more seeds than a small sunflower. how many sunflower seeds are there altogether?,A small sunflower has 3 dozen seeds and a large sunflower has 50% more seeds than a small sunflower. How many sunflower seeds are there altogether?,90,90,90,90,"Step 1: Convert dozens to individual seeds.
- A small sunflower has 3 dozen seeds.
