A $2000 watch was put on sale so that mr. Rogers bought it at 75% of its original price. He then sold the watch to his friend at 120% of the price that he bought it. What is the percentage discount obtained by Mr. Roger's friend from the original price?,A $2000 watch was put on sale so that Mr. Rogers bought it at 75% of its original price. He then sold the watch to his friend at 120% of the price that he bought it. What is the percentage discount obtained by Mr. Roger's friend from the original price?,10,10,10,10,"Step 1: Original price of the watch = 2000.

Step 2: Mr. Rogers bought it at 75% of original price:
