"John rents his car out 10 times a month for 3 hours each time. He gets paid $25 an hour. If his car payment is $500, how much profit does he make on his CaR?","John rents his car out 10 times a month for 3 hours each time. He gets paid $25 an hour. If his car payment is $500, how much profit does he make on his car?",250,250,250,250,"Step 1: Determine total hours rented per month.
