Amy had two eyeshadow palettes with four colors each and three makeup sets that came with six eyeshadow colors each. Her sister steals one of the palettes. Amy uses up half of the colors from one makeup set. How many eyeshadow colors does she have lEfT?,Amy had two eyeshadow palettes with four colors each and three makeup sets that came with six eyeshadow colors each. Her sister steals one of the palettes. Amy uses up half of the colors from one makeup set. How many eyeshadow colors does she have left?,19,19,19,19,"Let’s break it down step by step.

- Initial eyeshadow colors:
  - Palettes: 2 palettes × 4 colors each = 8 colors
  - Makeup sets: 3 sets × 6 colors each = 18 colors
  - Total initially = 8 + 18 = 26 colors

- Her sister steals one palette:
  - One palette = 4 colors, so remaining = 26 − 4 = 22 colors

- Amy uses up half of the colors from one makeup set:
  - One set has 6 colors; half used up = 3 colors
  - Remaining after use = 22 − 3 = 19 colors

